# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
coverage
*.local
# ...but NOT the dev stack's build file. `*.local` comes from Vite's template,
# where it means .env.local and friends — it silently swallowed Dockerfile.local
# too, so the file docker-compose.yml builds this console FROM was untracked. A
# fresh clone had no Dockerfile.local and `./maintainerd up --build` failed on a
# missing file. maintainerd-auth tracks its copies; this brings the two in line.
!Dockerfile.local

# Local environment. NEVER commit one: even though this console is a public
# OAuth client with no client secret, a real .env pins an operator's hosts.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Editor directories and files
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?
